  <description>Waveshare ESP32-S3-Zero mini development board, 23.5 x 18 mm, USB-C, 4 MB flash, 2 MB PSRAM, WS2812 RGB LED on GPIO21, BOOT button on GPIO0. 2x9 header holes (2.54 mm pitch, 15.24 mm row spacing) plus 3 top pads and 8 bottom pads.</description>
